{"id":"snow-queen","name":{"en":"Snow Queen","ja":"雪の女王","tc":"雪之女王","sc":"雪之女王"},"desc1":{"en":"This fruit has a distinct flavor. Unripe ones are called 'snow princesses.' They are so sour that they can't be eaten.","ja":"「深い味わいが特徴の木の実ね。ちなみに、熟　してないものは『雪の姫君』っていってね。　すっぱくてとても食べられたものじゃないの」","tc":"「這種果實的特徵就是深奧的風味呢。　順帶一提，還沒成熟的稱為『雪之公主』　非常地酸，根本吃不下口。」","sc":"“这种果实的特征就是醇厚的风味呢。　顺带一提，还没成熟的时候称为“雪之公主”　非常地酸，根本吃不下口。”"},"desc2":{"en":"They're willful when they're a princess I guess.","ja":"「ああ、お姫様のときはわがままなんだね…」","tc":"「喔喔，當公主的時候還很任性呢……」","sc":"“哦哦，当公主的时候还很任性呢……”"},"char1":"liane","char2":"firis","level":21,"trait":{"id":"frozen-delicacy","name":{"en":"Frozen Delicacy","ja":"凍てつく美味しさ","tc":"使人凍結的美味","sc":"使人冻结的美味"}},"categories":[{"id":"foodstuff","name":{"en":"(Foodstuff)","ja":"（食材）","tc":"（食材）","sc":"（食材）"},"icon":"firis-category-foodstuff","add":false},{"id":"water","name":{"en":"(Water)","ja":"（水）","tc":"（水）","sc":"（水）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-water","add":false},{"id":"hidden-power","name":{"en":"(Hidden Power)","ja":"（神秘の力）","tc":"（神祕之力）","sc":"（神秘之力）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-magic-tools","add":false}],"locations":[{"id":"south-auoro-snowfield","name":{"en":"South Auoro Snowfield","ja":"南アオロ雪原","tc":"南奧羅雪原","sc":"南奥罗雪原"}},{"id":"north-auoro-snowfield","name":{"en":"North Auoro Snowfield","ja":"北アオロ雪原","tc":"北奧羅雪原","sc":"北奥罗雪原"}},{"id":"riesentrain","name":{"en":"Riesentrain","ja":"リーゼントレーネ","tc":"利傑特列聶","sc":"利杰特列聂"}}],"fixed_components":[{"color":"red","name":{"en":"Sweet","ja":"甘い","tc":"甜的","sc":"甜的"},"value":20}],"random_components":[{"color":"green","name":{"en":"Fresh","ja":"新鮮","tc":"新鮮","sc":"新鲜"},"value":20},{"color":"red","name":{"en":"Much Flesh","ja":"果肉が多い","tc":"果肉很多","sc":"果肉很多"},"value":20},{"color":"blue","name":{"en":"Frosty","ja":"霜がつく","tc":"結霜","sc":"结霜"},"value":10}],"catalyst":{"size":5,"color":["white","white","white","yellow"],"action":{"en":["Use Count +5","Effect Level -4 Yellow","Effect Level -4 Purple","Effect Level +2 Yellow"],"ja":["使用回数＋５","効果レ